"aray (dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Mariksa hardwar"
"e sareng alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi r"
"aray (dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Parangkat keras"
" TPM dideteksi. Masang <i>tpm2-tools</i> otomatis..."

#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi r"
"aray (dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2."
"0 aktip. Sandi anjeun bakal disegel aman di jero TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi r"
"aray (dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Parangkat keras"
" TPM dideteksi, tapi pamasangan otomatis <i>tpm2-tools</i> gagal. Jala"
"nkeun <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Ragrag deui kana cache"
" credential basis software."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci {} anjeun nganggo auténtikasi r"
"aray (dompét anu dideteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Taya hardware T"
"PM nu dideteksi. Ngagunakeun cache credential basis software (AES-256-"
"GCM)."

